<title>USA: Wildwood Crest, N.J., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Wildwood Crest, N.J., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities, Inc said it won $6.833 million of Wilddwood Crest, N.J., unlimited tax general bonds of 1997, with a lowest rate of 5.10, highest price of 100.0407.</p>
</text>
